<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p data-start="121" data-end="309" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Big changes are coming to shared mobility in Columbus! As our city continues to grow, we’re committed to making it easier, safer, and more convenient for you to get where you need to go.</strong></p>
<p data-start="311" data-end="569" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We’re thrilled to announce upcoming enhancements to our shared mobility options, giving you more flexibility and access than ever before. Whether you bike, scoot, or rely on other forms of shared transportation, these updates are designed with you in mind.</p>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%"><hr></td></tr></table>
<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" data-start="571" data-end="619" align="center"><strong data-start="575" data-end="617">Special Offer for Former CoGo Members!</strong></h1>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p data-start="620" data-end="817" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">As part of this transition, <strong>Veo is offering 6-month memberships to VeoPlus for all qualifying former CoGo members—a $48 value!</strong> This means more access, more convenience, and more ways to ride.</p>
<p data-start="819" data-end="878" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="https://veoride.typeform.com/to/ggDBwR7E?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Riders can learn more and sign up here</a></p>
<p data-start="880" data-end="976" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Stay connected for updates, and get ready to experience a better way to move through Columbus!</p>
